# Instantiation (tasks.org, aida-referents-instantiation, decided
# 2026-10-21): a generic statement bears on its instances, an attack on an
# instance on that instance alone.  supp presumes that anybody beats
# anybody; calm presumes that Conrad does not beat Peter.  brawl owes
# beat conrad peter and beat peter conrad: the first is contested, the
# second IN through supp, and the generic statement stays IN.
lk.
pipeline unfolded.
declare iota : type.
declare conrad, peter : iota.
declare beat : iota -> iota -> bool.
argument brawl : beat [conrad] [peter] - ~beat [peter] [conrad].
elim.
elim.
next.
next.
dixi.
argument supp : beat [?x] [?y].
by default.
dixi.
counterargument calm : beat [conrad] [peter].
by default.
dixi.
